    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508320/extras/0112d10550b39fc179347c795a1caed4.avif?t=1743660913\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crumps</strong> is a small, social, multiplayer, platforming game where you are a <strong>Crump</strong>! <strong>:3</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOMEWHAT SOCIAL SANDBOX!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run around and do whatever! Currently there is mostly just platforming but there is more to come!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your own <strong>Crump</strong>! Tons of customization options brought to you by our very own <strong>NAE!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY WITH FRIENDS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full <strong>Multiplayer</strong> with <strong>Hosting</strong> and <strong>Joining</strong> games! Play with your friends or make new ones in game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHYSICS BASED CHARACTERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crump's will react to physics and other Crumps! Crumps can flail around, get launched, slide down things, and more!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508320/extras/0112d10550b39fc179347c795a1caed4.avif?t=1743660913\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crumps</strong> is a small, social, multiplayer, platforming game where you are a <strong>Crump</strong>! <strong>:3</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOMEWHAT SOCIAL SANDBOX!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run around and do whatever! Currently there is mostly just platforming but there is more to come!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your own <strong>Crump</strong>! Tons of customization options brought to you by our very own <strong>NAE!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY WITH FRIENDS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full <strong>Multiplayer</strong> with <strong>Hosting</strong> and <strong>Joining</strong> games! Play with your friends or make new ones in game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHYSICS BASED CHARACTERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crump's will react to physics and other Crumps! Crumps can flail around, get launched, slide down things, and more!</p>",
